      "turnId": "t3-4f44f055",
      "final": "Tell me a story about a rabbit.",
      "turnKind": "chat",
      "answer": "Once upon a time, in a lush green meadow, there lived a swift and charming rabbit named Thumper. Thumper loved to hop around the meadow, admiring the flowers and listening to the songs of the birds. One sunny afternoon, while Thumper was enjoying the warmth of the sun, a group of rabbits noticed his fluffy white tail and his bright, curious eyes. They came to him, curious about his home. Thumper, being very friendly, invited them to visit his burrow. The rabbits found it to be a cozy and well-arranged home, complete with a small pool of fresh water. From that day on, the rabbits visited Thumper often, and Thumper had more friends in the meadow.",
